error[NK2106]: `p.items` is bound to `k` by a `let`, but `p` is only borrowed here.
  --> tests/let_moved_ref_parameter.nika:4:5
   |
 4 |     let k = p.items
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: `p` belongs to whoever lent it (a `ref` parameter, a `for` over a list, a `let` over a place), so you can't give a part of it away.
   = note: Nikaia never makes a copy behind your back.
   = help: Hand over a copy: `p.items.clone()`.

